  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1734626510_7598167_475570f0dea6ec05c66de39cbedd63bb.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">GripBro is a brand dedicated to empowering individuals through strength and fitness. We design compact, effective tools for enhancing grip strength and forearm power, helping users achieve their fitness goals and unlock their true potential.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">GripBro hand grippers are portable, adjustable resistance tools designed to improve grip strength, forearm endurance, and overall hand functionality. Perfect for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and anyone seeking a stronger, more capable grip. Train anywhere, anytime, with GripGrow.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p>GripGrow offers adjustable resistance, compact design, and built-in grip strength tracking, ensuring a customizable and measurable fitness experience. It's a small tool with big results.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We accept secure payments through Shopify, including credit cards, PayPal, and Shop Pay. Payments are processed instantly, ensuring quick order confirmation and delivery.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Other information:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">GripGrow products are built with durable materials and come with a satisfaction guarantee. Whether you're at home, in class, or at the gym, GripGrow is your go-to fitness companion. Train smarter, grow stronger!</p>\r\n</div>",
